{"id":"327e2fc2c4b97c82","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-nno-universal.md","title":"thm-nno-universal-property","display":"thm-nno-universal-property","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-nno-universal","aliases":["16-thm-nno-universal","16-thm--nno-universal"],"display":"thm-nno-universal-property","depends_on":["[[16-df-nno]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-nno-universal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-nno-universal</span><span>16-thm--nno-universal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nno-universal-property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ddbc8ac3dacc270e\" href=\"?note=ddbc8ac3dacc270e\" title=\"16-df-nno\">16-df-nno</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> (具有终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的范畴)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\mathcal C\">\\(N\\in\\mathcal C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z:1\\to N\">\\(z:1\\to N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:N\\to N\">\\(s:N\\to N\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NNO}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{NNO}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> (自然数对象谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal C\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0:1\\to X\">\\(x_0:1\\to X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:X\\to X\">\\(g:X\\to X